  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tanzania Human Rights Defenders Coalition THRDC 2023-2025 - Tanzania Human Rights Defenders Coalition THRDC</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tanzania Human Rights Defenders Coalition THRDC 2023-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tanzania Human Rights Defenders Coalition (THRDC) is a non-governmental membership organisation registered under the NGO act. It has grown in importance since it was first formed 2012 and now comprises of almost 250 member organisations. THRDC is a strong player for Human Rights Defenders (HRDs) and has been able to build links with key national government institutions such as the Commission of Human Rights and Good Governance (CHRAGG), Registrar of NGO:s, police force and the legislature.  

The main goal of THRDC is to enhance security and protection of the HRDs in Tanzania and to create a safer working environment. It also intends to strengthen regional and international interventions towards protection and promotion of the rights and responsibilities of the HRDs. 

The Strategic Plan for 2023-2027 focus on three key results areas: 

a. Preventive protection and security management: Assurance of preventive protection and security management of HRDs (who are at potential risks).
b. Members empowerment and public engagement: Strengthen THRDC members and other stakeholders capacities and resilience.
c. THRDCs institutional sustenance: Improvement of institutional performance and sustainability.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tanzania Human Rights Defenders Coalition (THRDC) is a non-governmental membership organisation registered under the NGO act. It has grown in importance since it was first formed 2012 and now comprises of almost 250 member organisations. THRDC is a strong player for Human Rights Defenders (HRDs) and has been able to build links with key national government institutions such as the Commission of Human Rights and Good Governance (CHRAGG), Registrar of NGO:s, police force and the legislature.  

The main goal of THRDC is to enhance security and protection of the HRDs in Tanzania and to create a safer working environment. It also intends to strengthen regional and international interventions towards protection and promotion of the rights and responsibilities of the HRDs.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tanzania Human Rights Defenders Coalition (THRDC) &#xE4;r en icke-statlig medlemsorganisation och  registrerad NGO. Koalitionen har vuxit i betydelse sedan den f&#xF6;rst bildades 2012 och best&#xE5;r nu av n&#xE4;stan 250 medlemsorganisationer. THRDC &#xE4;r en stark akt&#xF6;r f&#xF6;r m&#xE4;nniskor&#xE4;ttsf&#xF6;rsvarare och har kunnat bygga broar med viktiga nationella regeringsinstitutioner som Commission of Human Rights and Good Governance (CHRAGG), registrator of NGO:s, polisen och r&#xE4;ttsv&#xE4;sendet.

Det huvudsakliga m&#xE5;let f&#xF6;r THRDC &#xE4;r att f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttra s&#xE4;kerheten och skyddet av m&#xE4;nniskor&#xE4;ttsf&#xF6;rsvarare i Tanzania och att skapa en s&#xE4;krare arbetsmilj&#xF6; f&#xF6;r dessa. De avser ocks&#xE5; att st&#xE4;rka regionala och internationella insatser f&#xF6;r att skydda och fr&#xE4;mja m&#xE4;nniskors r&#xE4;ttigheter och skyldigheter.</narrative>
  </description>
